WEBVTT

00:17.011 --> 00:19.311
Lookie, another friend for you.

00:19.561 --> 00:23.451
You all play nice now, until tomorrow.

00:27.721 --> 00:30.691
Um, are you all right?

00:30.691 --> 00:31.811
Yes.

00:32.351 --> 00:34.321
Thank you very much.

00:35.441 --> 00:37.381
Excuse me.

00:43.361 --> 00:44.711
Let's see.

00:51.701 --> 00:53.971
Come on, let's go.

00:56.401 --> 00:57.541
Okay...

01:06.991 --> 01:09.361
Please wait here a bit.

01:11.741 --> 01:13.171
Good evening.

01:13.171 --> 01:14.531
Y-You're...!

01:14.531 --> 01:15.231
Argh!

01:15.231 --> 01:16.991
How dare you?!

01:17.131 --> 01:19.001
Gahh!

01:21.671 --> 01:23.501
Thank you for waiting.

01:24.351 --> 01:25.971
Now, let's go.

01:25.971 --> 01:27.511
Y-Yes...

01:31.701 --> 01:33.251
What's this?

01:33.251 --> 01:35.251
Where do you think you're going?

01:37.111 --> 01:40.011
I don't know how you got out, but—

01:52.081 --> 01:53.521
Sorry for that.

01:53.781 --> 01:55.461
You're safe now.

02:11.451 --> 02:13.051
We were so scared!

02:13.051 --> 02:14.271
Thank you!

02:14.271 --> 02:16.541
Thank you so much!

02:16.781 --> 02:18.751
Thank you so much!

02:18.751 --> 02:20.051
Thank you!

02:21.401 --> 02:24.321
Please calm yourself, Princess Olivia.

02:25.051 --> 02:27.561
How do... you know my name?

02:27.891 --> 02:29.841
I'm so glad you're safe.

02:29.841 --> 02:32.251
Olivia Arnold, the second 
in line to the throne.

02:33.741 --> 02:36.311
Um, you are...

02:36.311 --> 02:39.331
I'm an Astral of the Arnold Army.

02:39.331 --> 02:40.911
My name is Lily.

02:45.211 --> 02:50.111
<i>That was when Ray and I first met.</i>

03:03.761 --> 03:06.301
I need more Ray in my life.

03:34.131 --> 03:35.651
Good morning, Ray.

03:35.651 --> 03:36.761
Good morning, Elisa.

03:36.761 --> 03:38.701
Everything all right?

03:38.701 --> 03:41.711
Yes. You just seem different than usual.

03:41.711 --> 03:42.861
Oh really?

03:42.861 --> 03:45.451
But the same goes for you.

03:45.451 --> 03:46.391
You think so?

03:49.511 --> 03:53.641
<b>The Iceblade <b>Sorcerer
</b>Shall <b>Rule </b>the <b>World</b></b>

03:54.231 --> 03:58.021
<b>Episode 01
The Boy Who Is the World's Strongest Sorcerer
Participates in a Large Scale Magic Battle Tournament</b>

04:05.871 --> 04:07.971
Regarding the other day's incident.

04:07.971 --> 04:11.441
You're saying Evan Bernstein acted alone?

04:11.441 --> 04:15.141
There's been no movement from 
Eugenics' main forces until now,

04:15.141 --> 04:17.101
so that is a fair assumption.

04:17.101 --> 04:21.241
And Paratrogo, who aided him, is safely 
locked away in a special prison.

04:21.891 --> 04:23.351
Evan is...

04:23.721 --> 04:25.941
...dead.

04:26.711 --> 04:30.231
The Hale clan took care of the aftermath.

04:32.021 --> 04:35.721
By the way, Lydia, how is he doing?

04:36.511 --> 04:37.701
Oh, him?

04:37.701 --> 04:39.311
He's doing well.

04:39.311 --> 04:41.741
He has his school life and his friends.

04:42.621 --> 04:47.871
I think that environment is a 
good influence on him right now.

04:48.801 --> 04:53.271
It might happen sooner 
than I anticipated.

04:54.681 --> 04:56.191
Hey, did you hear?

04:56.191 --> 04:57.501
You mean that thing?

04:57.501 --> 04:59.621
If it's about White, then...

04:59.621 --> 05:00.591
What?!

05:01.341 --> 05:04.301
No! I'm talking about the Magicks War!

05:01.341 --> 05:04.961
Thing... thing...

05:04.961 --> 05:10.521
Oh, the completely new team battle that
doesn't limit anything to school or year?

05:10.761 --> 05:13.711
I heard it will take place 
before the choir event.

05:14.011 --> 05:15.911
White's thing...

05:15.911 --> 05:16.871
Seriously.

05:17.721 --> 05:20.281
It's three people per team, right?

05:20.281 --> 05:22.521
I bet Al wants to enter, right?

05:22.521 --> 05:27.671
Yeah, but if it's Wisel and me, 
we'd only get in Al's way, right?

05:27.901 --> 05:32.781
You do realize that would mean
you'd be eliminated instantly, right?

05:32.781 --> 05:34.041
Right?

05:34.041 --> 05:38.291
The reason he's been going somewhere 
with Evi lately is...

05:40.101 --> 05:42.581
These two broad-chested guys...

05:42.581 --> 05:43.471
Hustle!

05:43.471 --> 05:44.541
Muscle!

05:45.501 --> 05:46.801
Hey.

05:47.401 --> 05:50.301
So what'll happen, I wonder?

05:50.301 --> 05:53.851
I mean Amelia is the new 
champion of Magic Chevalier.

05:55.161 --> 05:58.011
I don't think she's too interested.

05:58.011 --> 05:59.681
I guess that makes sense.

05:59.681 --> 06:02.571
She probably has no reason 
to enter the competition.

06:02.571 --> 06:03.901
Right.

06:10.961 --> 06:13.011
My feelings...

06:13.541 --> 06:18.861
I started reading this love story by 
Luna Ether because Ray was reading it...

06:20.071 --> 06:23.341
I would've never expected it 
to pierce my soul like this.

06:23.341 --> 06:24.211
Oh...

06:24.211 --> 06:25.271
La sta—

06:27.561 --> 06:29.031
Who's there?

06:29.031 --> 06:33.591
Amelia, I'd like you to compete 
in the "Magicks War" with me.

06:33.991 --> 06:36.411
Amelia, please open up.

06:36.411 --> 06:37.591
Amelia?!

06:37.941 --> 06:39.481
Coming.

06:39.481 --> 06:44.211
Amelia, will you enter 
the Magicks War with... us?

06:53.221 --> 06:55.251
It's probably that thing, right?

06:56.361 --> 06:57.621
Indeed!

06:58.751 --> 07:00.601
What about you, Ray?

07:00.601 --> 07:04.131
I'm going to talk to my master 
about it, but I would like to enter.

07:04.921 --> 07:06.381
You in good form?

07:06.381 --> 07:09.761
It's just my personal opinion, 
but it's not bad.

07:09.761 --> 07:10.871
I see.

07:12.681 --> 07:16.131
Um, is something wrong with you, Ray?

07:16.961 --> 07:20.471
Hey, if we're going to be a team,

07:20.471 --> 07:23.501
shouldn't you properly explain 
what's going on to Ariane?

07:23.501 --> 07:25.021
You're right.

07:25.021 --> 07:27.551
I should give her a proper explanation.

07:28.001 --> 07:29.891
What are you talking about?

07:29.891 --> 07:34.411
Ariane, I am the Iceblade Sorcerer.

07:36.111 --> 07:36.981
Huh?

07:37.521 --> 07:39.431
Please hold on a moment.

07:39.431 --> 07:43.941
I'm sure I must have misheard that, 
so could you please repeat that?

07:44.601 --> 07:46.931
I am one of the seven grand sorcerers,

07:47.431 --> 07:49.301
the Iceblade Sorcerer.

07:50.951 --> 07:52.051
Amelia?!

07:53.151 --> 07:54.221
Yes.

07:54.221 --> 07:56.301
How long have you known?

07:56.301 --> 08:01.171
Since before the Magic Chevalier, I guess.

08:02.591 --> 08:03.831
Unfair.

08:04.821 --> 08:06.291
That's so unfair!

08:06.811 --> 08:10.111
I'd heard that you two 
were training together.

08:10.111 --> 08:13.111
But I never understood why 
you were training with Ray.

08:13.111 --> 08:15.811
It always bothered me!

08:16.061 --> 08:18.571
So that's what was going on!

08:18.901 --> 08:20.671
I'll say it again...

08:21.451 --> 08:22.701
That's so unfair!

08:22.701 --> 08:24.581
You got one-on-one training!

08:24.581 --> 08:26.871
From such an amazing person!

08:27.711 --> 08:31.831
Um, well, I'm sorry.

08:33.211 --> 08:36.331
Ariane, so you believe me?

08:37.901 --> 08:40.711
It certainly explains a lot of mysteries.

08:40.711 --> 08:42.341
Ariane...

08:42.531 --> 08:44.611
So... yes.

08:45.691 --> 08:49.211
Then let's talk about 
the past a little bit.

08:51.211 --> 08:53.771
Hey, hey, so what are 
you doing after this?

08:53.771 --> 08:54.881
Want to go get a drink?

08:54.881 --> 08:57.491
Why not? What about you, Lydia?

08:57.491 --> 08:59.641
Guess it can't hurt, once in a while.

08:59.641 --> 09:00.861
What do you say, Carla?

09:00.861 --> 09:03.061
Yes, I'll join.

09:03.061 --> 09:04.551
Lydia-senpai.

09:05.491 --> 09:07.251
I need to talk to you.

09:07.251 --> 09:09.161
That means you're coming too, then!

09:09.161 --> 09:10.241
I'm sorry?

09:15.121 --> 09:18.531
And that's how I'm here, now.

09:21.491 --> 09:23.641
How horrible!

09:24.681 --> 09:29.611
The Far East War was the first war where 
magic was used in real battles...

09:29.611 --> 09:32.991
I heard that it was the 
worst war of all time.

09:33.581 --> 09:37.251
And you were at the front lines 
there from such a young age...

09:40.391 --> 09:43.851
But that's where I met my 
master and the others.

09:43.851 --> 09:45.781
And now I'm here.

09:45.781 --> 09:50.041
So is that the master who gave you the 
title of Iceblade after the war ended?

09:50.041 --> 09:51.121
Yes.

09:51.121 --> 09:54.901
Overheating means I still 
can't release its full power,

09:55.371 --> 09:58.101
but I did inherit the name 
and station from my master.

10:00.001 --> 10:01.041
Ray...

10:03.561 --> 10:05.051
I challenge you!

10:05.051 --> 10:06.871
Wait, what?

10:06.871 --> 10:08.531
Why are you doing this?

10:08.531 --> 10:11.811
Amelia, this is my fate as a maiden!

10:11.811 --> 10:14.311
Your fate as a what now?

10:16.801 --> 10:17.931
What are the terms?

10:17.931 --> 10:20.711
Whoever says "I yield," loses.

10:21.131 --> 10:22.461
Understood.

10:23.421 --> 10:25.571
We haven't had a chance since last time.

10:25.841 --> 10:26.881
That's true.

10:26.881 --> 10:27.711
Well...

10:27.711 --> 10:30.211
things were a bit different then.

10:31.041 --> 10:33.701
Amelia, will you be the referee?

10:33.981 --> 10:35.011
Okay.

10:35.011 --> 10:36.711
Are you sure about this though?

10:36.711 --> 10:39.961
You ended up using your powers 
with Rebecca-senpai, too.

10:41.231 --> 10:42.291
Yes.

10:42.291 --> 10:44.621
But this time, I won't use them.

10:44.621 --> 10:47.111
And you think you can
beat Ariane like that?

10:47.111 --> 10:49.841
Well, I will try.

10:50.181 --> 10:52.851
Then, let's begin!

10:52.851 --> 10:54.101
Ogre!

11:07.901 --> 11:10.631
I... yield.

11:11.681 --> 11:13.941
Did you use some kind of special magic?

11:13.941 --> 11:14.971
No.

11:14.971 --> 11:17.671
Just an inside code 
to enhance my body.

11:18.001 --> 11:19.531
You must be lying!

11:19.531 --> 11:23.321
There's no way you could defeat 
my Ogre with just an inside code!

11:23.751 --> 11:26.261
There are no lies here.

11:28.061 --> 11:31.011
So this this is the power of 
one of the grand seven...

11:31.331 --> 11:33.521
Even when you're not at 
your full strength,

11:33.521 --> 11:35.861
you completely overwhelmed me.

11:35.861 --> 11:36.971
Ariane.

11:37.601 --> 11:41.851
This victory was only possible because 
I spotted your weakness.

11:41.851 --> 11:43.521
My weakness?

11:43.521 --> 11:46.031
You have lots of potential to improve!

11:47.021 --> 11:50.161
Ariane, do you want to get stronger?

11:51.761 --> 11:53.331
Of course!

11:53.331 --> 11:54.791
That's the spirit.

11:54.971 --> 11:56.721
Well then, Ariane Algren!

11:57.211 --> 12:01.291
I'll assign you an Ainsworth-style 
bootcamp special regimen!

12:01.291 --> 12:03.291
That sounds excellent!

12:03.291 --> 12:05.201
Th-This can't be real!

12:05.201 --> 12:08.001
B-But since I finished it, 
I'm fine, right?!

12:08.001 --> 12:09.521
I've already got my ranger badge.

12:09.521 --> 12:11.381
It's just for Ariane, right?!

12:11.381 --> 12:12.271
Yeah.

12:13.311 --> 12:14.301
However!

12:14.301 --> 12:16.321
I'll assign you a separate 
training course!

12:16.321 --> 12:17.431
Wha?!

12:17.431 --> 12:20.981
For you, engaging with magic is more 
pertinent than training your body.

12:21.421 --> 12:25.581
Listen up! For the Magicks War, 
we need to strengthen your body first!

12:25.581 --> 12:28.071
And there's only one important thing!

12:28.071 --> 12:29.821
Your answer is "ranger!"

12:29.821 --> 12:32.861
Do you understand, trainee Amelia?!

12:32.861 --> 12:34.831
Ranger, I say!

12:34.831 --> 12:35.831
Ranger!

12:35.831 --> 12:37.591
Training will commence 
immediately tomorrow!

12:37.591 --> 12:38.721
Do you understand?

12:38.721 --> 12:39.781
Ranger!

12:39.781 --> 12:40.371
I say!

12:40.371 --> 12:41.211
Again!

12:41.211 --> 12:42.501
Ranger!

12:42.501 --> 12:45.471
I mean, nooo!

12:52.921 --> 12:55.371
Good morning, Ray.

12:56.581 --> 12:58.611
Good morning, senpai.

12:58.611 --> 13:00.491
You're out early again.

13:00.491 --> 13:03.881
Because today's the day 
we have our shift together.

13:03.881 --> 13:05.511
How are you doing?

13:05.871 --> 13:08.801
I'm doing well, thanks to you.

13:08.801 --> 13:11.111
And I can use magic 
without problems, too.

13:11.361 --> 13:12.891
I'm very happy to hear that.

13:12.891 --> 13:17.801
It's all thanks to the 
spell you cast on me.

13:21.231 --> 13:22.471
That reminds me.

13:22.471 --> 13:25.051
I heard you are participating 
in the Magicks War.

13:25.051 --> 13:25.961
Yes.

13:26.271 --> 13:28.861
I am going to form a team 
with Amelia and Ariane.

13:31.221 --> 13:32.931
Is something wrong?

13:32.931 --> 13:35.551
You're surrounded by only women.

13:35.551 --> 13:36.831
Really?

13:36.831 --> 13:38.291
There are Evi and Albert,

13:38.291 --> 13:40.761
and all the guys from the 
Environmental Research Club.

13:41.191 --> 13:43.741
Sure, but...

13:44.061 --> 13:46.461
I'd like to be with you too.

13:46.461 --> 13:48.441
You shouldn't push yourself right now.

13:49.001 --> 13:51.491
I worry about you.

13:51.491 --> 13:54.001
You do?

13:54.501 --> 13:55.721
Yes.

13:55.721 --> 13:57.991
I'm always thinking about you.

13:57.991 --> 13:59.491
<i>Ba-boom!</i>

13:59.491 --> 14:01.501
Oh, come on now.

14:01.501 --> 14:04.951
Ray, you're so...

14:04.951 --> 14:06.011
Seriously...

14:07.351 --> 14:08.611
Ray...

14:08.611 --> 14:09.801
Senpai?

14:09.801 --> 14:11.011
Ray!

14:11.011 --> 14:12.241
Amelia.

14:12.241 --> 14:14.141
I figured I'd find you here.

14:12.621 --> 14:13.641
Grr.

14:14.141 --> 14:17.051
I wanted to ask you something 
about my training.

14:17.051 --> 14:18.141
Got it.

14:18.141 --> 14:19.611
I'll meet you in the classroom, 
once I'm done here.

14:19.611 --> 14:21.041
All right, thank you.

14:21.041 --> 14:22.171
Ahem!

14:23.011 --> 14:25.651
Good morning, Amelia.

14:25.081 --> 14:26.521
Kinokon!

14:26.521 --> 14:29.501
Good morning, Rebecca-senpai.

14:28.881 --> 14:30.891
Takepoko, takepoko.

14:30.511 --> 14:33.411
I'll send Ray over

14:33.411 --> 14:37.751
after the "two of us" 
enjoy breakfast "alone."

14:36.081 --> 14:38.661
I want curry!

14:38.661 --> 14:41.661
Is that an abuse of your station?

14:39.311 --> 14:41.371
They have hayashi rice, too!

14:41.661 --> 14:43.151
As the president of the club?

14:43.151 --> 14:44.211
Or...

14:44.211 --> 14:46.411
As the president of the student council?

14:46.411 --> 14:49.921
Oh no, no such thing is happening.

14:49.631 --> 14:52.431
Takepoko, takepoko.

14:49.921 --> 14:50.861
Kinokon!

14:53.051 --> 14:54.911
<i>What's all this pressure?</i>

14:54.911 --> 14:57.191
<i>And these strange animals?</i>

14:57.391 --> 14:58.621
One moment.

15:02.341 --> 15:03.911
What is this?!

15:03.911 --> 15:05.281
Amelia.

15:05.281 --> 15:06.181
Yes?

15:06.801 --> 15:08.611
Can we make a deal?

15:09.131 --> 15:11.691
A deal...?

15:11.691 --> 15:13.711
I'm worried!

15:13.961 --> 15:16.151
About?

15:16.151 --> 15:17.531
About Ariane.

15:17.531 --> 15:18.711
How so?

15:18.711 --> 15:24.211
Her training would have her be 
with Ray all day long... alone.

15:24.211 --> 15:26.211
I suppose that's true, yes.

15:26.211 --> 15:27.721
That's dangerous!

15:27.721 --> 15:29.721
I'm sure she also thinks of Ray as...

15:29.721 --> 15:30.971
N-No way!

15:30.971 --> 15:32.421
I don't think...

15:31.511 --> 15:34.471
Put your hand on your 
heart and think about it!

15:34.471 --> 15:36.581
I'm certain you know 
what I'm talking about!

15:38.791 --> 15:41.491
I want to keep living, next to you.

15:41.491 --> 15:42.301
Amelia!

15:42.301 --> 15:43.481
Get up!

15:43.481 --> 15:44.431
Want a bite?

15:45.271 --> 15:46.311
So, what do you say?

15:46.311 --> 15:48.731
But I mean, still...

15:48.731 --> 15:51.301
He's oblivious to the fact 
that he's a total charmer.

15:51.301 --> 15:54.481
We can't afford another rival 
who's smitten with him.

15:55.151 --> 15:57.241
Don't you agree?

16:04.251 --> 16:05.001
Ray!

16:05.001 --> 16:07.611
You got invited by Ariane, right?

16:07.611 --> 16:08.611
Yeah.

16:09.261 --> 16:13.251
Thinking about it,
you and her have a good vibe.

16:13.251 --> 16:14.611
Personality-wise.

16:14.611 --> 16:16.521
Does that mean you know her well?

16:16.521 --> 16:19.271
I mean, we've met at noble parties.

16:19.271 --> 16:20.651
How should I put it?

16:20.651 --> 16:22.761
She's pretty enthusiastic!

16:22.761 --> 16:25.241
True, she's passionate.

16:25.241 --> 16:26.951
I mean, her soul.

16:26.951 --> 16:28.861
I see.

16:28.861 --> 16:31.271
I get the same feeling.

16:31.271 --> 16:33.351
That makes sense then.

16:37.341 --> 16:38.911
Excuse me.

16:39.611 --> 16:42.241
Come right in, Amelia.

16:48.641 --> 16:50.361
Rebecca.

16:51.301 --> 16:55.781
So we're entering a non-aggression treaty 
for the duration of the tournament, I see.

16:59.711 --> 17:01.121
What's going on?

17:01.121 --> 17:02.081
Dina.

17:02.081 --> 17:03.061
Y-Yes.

17:03.621 --> 17:05.221
May I ask you a favor?

17:06.191 --> 17:07.561
Yes...

17:10.031 --> 17:11.441
We've been waiting for you.

17:11.441 --> 17:12.651
Evi.

17:12.651 --> 17:14.101
Albert, you're here too.

17:14.101 --> 17:17.261
We heard you formed a team 
with Amelia and Lady Ariane?

17:17.261 --> 17:18.141
Yeah.

17:18.841 --> 17:21.191
I wouldn't have minded 
being on a team with you.

17:21.421 --> 17:22.751
Sorry.

17:22.751 --> 17:24.371
No, we're actually thrilled.

17:24.371 --> 17:27.221
We want to see what fighting you is like.

17:27.221 --> 17:28.711
So you two...

17:28.921 --> 17:31.561
Yeah, we formed a team.

17:31.561 --> 17:33.461
From now on, we'll be rivals.

17:33.731 --> 17:35.691
Teams have three people on them.

17:35.691 --> 17:36.961
So who is your third?

17:37.741 --> 17:39.291
That's a good question.

17:39.291 --> 17:41.041
We don't have anyone yet...

17:42.081 --> 17:43.721
But we know who we want.

17:43.721 --> 17:45.141
I see.

17:45.521 --> 17:46.931
Good luck to us all!

17:47.361 --> 17:48.271
Yeah.

17:50.831 --> 17:52.471
To all of us.

17:53.561 --> 17:56.691
Oh, Ray! Did you get even taller?

17:56.691 --> 17:58.231
I didn't, Master.

17:58.521 --> 18:00.231
I see, I see.

18:00.231 --> 18:01.591
So, what's up?

18:01.591 --> 18:03.241
Right. So actually...

18:03.481 --> 18:05.241
This is about the Magicks War.

18:05.241 --> 18:07.001
Fast as always.

18:08.111 --> 18:09.461
Why not?

18:09.461 --> 18:11.901
Your overheating's gotten 
pretty good right?

18:11.901 --> 18:13.751
Yes. So then...

18:14.041 --> 18:16.561
You're free to do as you please.

18:17.861 --> 18:19.141
By the way...

18:20.551 --> 18:21.631
Hello.

18:21.631 --> 18:24.641
Ray White, it's been a while.

18:25.471 --> 18:27.101
Lieselotte.

18:27.641 --> 18:29.891
I was just wanting to speak with you.

18:30.131 --> 18:33.341
I was just asking Lydia for advice.

18:33.931 --> 18:35.901
More like forcing me to give it.

18:35.311 --> 18:36.881
Then it's perfect timing.

18:36.881 --> 18:39.421
Hey, don't ignore me.

18:37.651 --> 18:40.061
Because I had something I wanted 
to discuss with you, too.

18:45.631 --> 18:47.791
A good morning to you, Amelia.

18:48.521 --> 18:50.301
Good morning, Ariane.

18:52.541 --> 18:54.171
Is something wrong?

18:54.171 --> 18:57.951
Oh, nothing's wrong...

18:57.951 --> 18:59.671
Good morning, Amelia and Ariane!

19:01.661 --> 19:02.931
<i>He's here!</i>

19:02.931 --> 19:05.091
Good morning, Ray.

19:05.931 --> 19:08.611
That... is you, right?

19:08.931 --> 19:10.101
Phew...

19:10.101 --> 19:11.011
All right!

19:11.681 --> 19:13.951
We're going to start with 
a 20-kilometer run.

19:13.951 --> 19:15.451
Are you ready?

19:15.451 --> 19:17.061
Ranger! I say!

19:17.061 --> 19:18.891
So that part's unchanged.

19:18.891 --> 19:20.641
Trainee Amelia, what was that?

19:21.591 --> 19:25.211
R-Ranger!

19:25.451 --> 19:27.211
Ranger!

19:27.211 --> 19:29.211
Ranger!

19:29.211 --> 19:31.211
Rangfrrgb!

19:33.721 --> 19:37.481
So this is the Ainsworth-style bootcamp.

19:38.191 --> 19:40.811
Why do I have to do this too?

19:40.811 --> 19:43.731
This was a demonstration before 
we start our real training.

19:44.711 --> 19:48.081
Trainee Amelia, starting next week,

19:48.081 --> 19:50.231
you'll be on a special two-week 
training program.

19:52.331 --> 19:53.591
What's this?

19:53.591 --> 19:55.251
You'll find out when you get there.

19:55.251 --> 19:57.231
If you make it back alive,

19:57.231 --> 20:01.171
your magical abilities will increase 
to an even higher level.

20:01.171 --> 20:04.851
Trainee Ariane, you will sleep 
and train at my house back home.

20:04.851 --> 20:06.631
Ranger, I say!

20:07.781 --> 20:09.361
Now just one minute!

20:09.361 --> 20:10.411
What is it?

20:10.411 --> 20:12.831
I'm coming to your house too!

20:12.831 --> 20:15.371
No, what you need to train 
is your magical skills.

20:15.371 --> 20:18.631
Besides, we will only be doing 
physical training non-stop.

20:19.991 --> 20:21.171
Ariane!

20:21.171 --> 20:21.871
Yes?

20:21.871 --> 20:22.861
Over here!

20:23.251 --> 20:25.011
Ray, you stay there!

20:25.011 --> 20:27.971
Please be gentle.

20:30.021 --> 20:33.101
Up, up, down, down, left, 
right, left, right, B.

20:33.861 --> 20:37.271
Ray. I'll accept it for now.

20:37.271 --> 20:38.551
All right.

20:38.551 --> 20:39.991
Good to hear.

20:39.991 --> 20:41.671
So, what were you two talking about?

20:44.131 --> 20:46.171
Don't you worry about that!

20:45.231 --> 20:46.661
Right, right.

20:50.001 --> 20:52.401
I definitely need to keep an eye on this.

20:53.731 --> 20:55.421
What did you say?

20:55.751 --> 20:58.061
Starting this weekend, it seems.

21:00.051 --> 21:01.961
I can't believe this.

21:01.961 --> 21:03.791
He really has no self-awareness.

21:04.411 --> 21:06.551
I hope nothing happens.

21:06.551 --> 21:08.371
I think something might.

21:20.191 --> 21:22.401
So you're saying it's 
in the back of this?

21:22.401 --> 21:23.641
Let's go.

21:27.771 --> 21:28.851
You're here.

21:31.421 --> 21:33.201
I'm sorry for keeping you waiting.

21:34.781 --> 21:36.721
Let's go, Ariane!

21:37.461 --> 21:38.961
Yes, I say!

21:43.961 --> 21:46.641
Once we leave this place 
behind, it'll be right there.

21:47.791 --> 21:49.711
Yes, I say!

21:51.971 --> 21:53.971
Ray, what's wrong?

22:06.091 --> 22:07.491
Pow!

22:07.491 --> 22:08.781
Ray!

22:12.191 --> 22:13.491
A girl?!

22:13.491 --> 22:15.391
I missed you, Stella!

22:15.391 --> 22:17.051
You've grown again.

22:17.671 --> 22:19.501
Just a little.

22:19.741 --> 22:20.921
What about you, Big Brother?

22:20.921 --> 22:22.801
I'm the same as always.

22:22.801 --> 22:24.261
"Big Brother?!"

22:24.261 --> 22:26.441
Ariane, let me introduce you.

22:26.881 --> 22:28.631
I'm Stella White.

22:28.631 --> 22:30.711
I'm my big brother's little sister.

22:30.711 --> 22:32.271
Big brother!?

22:32.541 --> 22:34.381
Little sister?!

23:48.881 --> 23:49.651
I'm Rebecca.

23:48.891 --> 23:52.141
<b>~ Next Episode Preview ~</b>

23:48.891 --> 23:52.141
<b>~ Next Episode Preview ~</b>

23:49.651 --> 23:50.441
I'm Amelia.

23:50.441 --> 23:51.251
I'm Dina.

23:51.251 --> 23:52.131
This is the preview.

23:52.131 --> 23:53.931
The Magicks War is coming up.

23:53.931 --> 23:55.551
Everybody is training on their own.

23:55.551 --> 23:57.291
In some deep deep forest!

23:57.291 --> 23:58.891
In some deep deep forest!

23:58.891 --> 24:00.761
That person shows up again!

24:00.761 --> 24:02.431
I can't believe it!

24:02.431 --> 24:05.251
Next time on <i>The Iceblade 
Sorcerer Shall Rule the World!</i>

24:05.251 --> 24:06.741
Two!

24:07.191 --> 24:09.311
Episode 2 will be full of training and...

24:09.281 --> 24:09.321
<b>The Iceblade <b>Sorcerer
</b>Shall <b>Rule </b>the <b>World</b></b>

24:09.311 --> 24:12.741
"The Boy Who Is the World's 
Strongest Sorcerer Dons a Mask."

24:09.321 --> 24:15.101
<b>Episode 02
The Boy Who Is the
World's Strongest Sorcerer Dons a Mask</b>

24:12.741 --> 24:13.901
Again?!
